# Storefront listings

Gallery work and wanna-do listings share one shape: **photos + required style tag**. Do not bring back title, description, or price as required create/edit fields unless the user asks.

## Tags

Source of truth: `shared/galleryLabels.js`.

Current tags: Blackwork, Fine line, Shading, Color, Floral.

**Realism is removed.** Do not add it back. Do not invent a second tag list in Vue.

UI still displays lowercase via CSS; stored label strings stay as written in `GALLERY_WORK_LABELS`.

## Validation

`server/utils/productValidation.js` requires:

- a valid `label`
- at least one photo

`title`, `description`, and `price_cents` default empty / `0` on `Product`. Create must not fail if those are missing.

## Admin + cards

- Create / edit (`AdminCreate.vue`, `AdminForm.vue`): tag select + photos (+ active on edit)
- List (`AdminListings.vue`): image + tag + status — no price/stock columns
- Storefront cards: picture + tag only

## Stale API

`npm run server` watches `server/` and `shared/`. If old validation errors still appear (`title is required`, …), the Express process did not reload — restart it.
